      !>           Start encoded SCLK:   32827412705.000042
      !>           End encoded SCLK  :   32827414705.000042
      !>           TDB Seconds/tick  :             0.001000
      !>           +Z axis           :   0.81120505  -0.43593555   0.38975193
      !>           Angular velocity  :   0.00000000   0.00000000   0.00000000
      !>
